 conjecture: efficient allocations in the neoclassical growth model with private information","a":["Emilio Espino"],"y":2005,"c":"pub","j":"Journal of Economic Theory","v":"121","i":"2","p":"192-213","r":15,"l":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jet.2004.05.010","lt":"pub","doi":"10.1016/j.jet.2004.05.010"}]